ct pair, atomically saved, and published with `commit_and_push_tickets_branch(strict=True)`.\n- Re-read every forward/reverse mapping and re-ran fsck.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] `REB-806`, `REB-807`, and `REB-808` map bidirectionally to the three exact existing local code-review tickets listed above.\n- [x] No new local ticket or Jira issue is created, archived, or transitioned.\n- [x] The mutation runs under rebar’s unified tracker write lock and publishes through the supported commit-and-push seam.\n- [x] `rebar bridge fsck` reports no alerting `binding_drift` and no `store_integrity` findings after repair.\n- [x] A ticket comment records the guarded before/after evidence and delivered tracker commit.","detected_by":"binding-drift-canary","env_id":"dc707e75-c93d-47b1-b5dd-60ca1be0a2d0","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","8dec-4068-861a-446b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"Operational tickets-branch binding-store repair only; no tracked production or test files change.","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"cb450d56-c3ad-436f-8b57-55f79cafd42b","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["binding-drift-alert"],"ticket_id":"16c1-0f0c-8169-4696","ticket_type":"bug","title":"[binding-drift] bridge fsck found 4 audit finding(s)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["439b6c3d-10a9-44aa-b022-f2fa1ea96354","287322e4-effa-499e-94c4-5e29d6c8a0fe","bc5608e1-81a9-4b61-b867-57e18492b679","b35c0cb7-f0f8-42aa-8675-5fda0f4290c8","77920f65-19c1-4ac1-a9d4-828715f9c1a8","38ce69f0-51ad-4f8f-865c-e9cc0e1d0b98","740100b5-744b-42fd-ab57-bb140bb6be36","58275974-65ab-400d-8b3a-23bec8139af9","0a880c3e-0f07-4588-ad2c-b5076fa7b71e","cb450d56-c3ad-436f-8b57-55f79cafd42b","c4c949e6-c39f-4752-9ecd-7ec11d22f7a5"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"S